dates python_str_renamed v1
description "The same file as ../python_str.cal, with the alias the note of its W001 gives; check says nothing, and every target takes it. Its own alias differs from the other file's only so that the two go through the targets side by side"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31
  n        : int   range >=0 <=3

date str(due) = received
  + n days
